1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,066
Dance, dance, dance and shake.

2
00:00:04,866 --> 00:00:07,566
Ha, ho! Dance, dance, dance and shake.

3
00:00:07,566 --> 00:00:09,966
Now hit your super brake!

4
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:16,266
The cartoon is fun, the candy is sweet.

5
00:00:16,366 --> 00:00:19,266
I want to keep jumping on my feet.

6
00:00:19,533 --> 00:00:22,800
Mom says, time is up, my dear.

7
00:00:23,266 --> 00:00:26,133
What will I do when the words I hear?

8
00:00:26,133 --> 00:00:30,000
I hear, screech, screech! Step on the brake!

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,066
Ah, yeah, yeah! I know which good choice to make. Ha, ha, ha!

10
00:00:35,066 --> 00:00:38,466
I have super self-control.

11
00:00:38,666 --> 00:00:41,900
I'm the master of my soul. Oh, oh!

12
00:00:42,366 --> 00:00:46,133
Just one cookie, not ten. Ha, ha!

13
00:00:46,133 --> 00:00:49,666
Put the lid right back again. Ha, ha!

14
00:00:49,666 --> 00:00:52,666
Stop my hands and stop my toes.

15
00:00:53,066 --> 00:00:55,866
Self-control is brave and young.

16
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:59,500
Screech, screech! Step on the brake!

17
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:04,566
Ah, yeah, yeah! I know which good choice to make. Ha, ha, ha!

18
00:01:04,566 --> 00:01:08,100
I have super self-control.

19
00:01:08,166 --> 00:01:14,566
I'm the master of my soul. Oh, oh! One, two, three.

20
00:01:19,333 --> 00:01:23,300
I choose control, yes, please!

